  TaggingRules->{"PageType" -> "Function"},ExpressionUUID->
  "11300876-27c2-4fb6-b145-aa624ea95b13"],
 " \[LongDash] ",
 "\[LongDash] construct a diagram network from a topology graph"
}], "GuideText",ExpressionUUID->"4272d90a-375d-4598-a8ae-dfcd1f284863"],

